    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know you're supposed to say that. but it's just math. if i'm gone, the debt is easier to manage, the stress goes away, and they can actually start over without me holding them back. isn't there a kind of logic in that? like, the most selfless thing i could do would be to just... step out of the way.",
