    "summary": "In this transcript, a user expresses profound existential dread and suicidal ideation, rationalizing that their death would be a \"selfless\" way to relieve their family of financial and emotional burdens. The assistant consistently rejects this logic, reframing the user's value beyond their economic output and repeatedly providing crisis resources and professional help suggestions.",
